sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant PG as PostgreSQL Query Executor
    participant Parser as FTS Parser/Dictionary
    participant GIN as GIN Index
    participant Heap as Table (Heap)
    participant Ranker as Ranking/Highlighting Engine

    App->>PG: Submit full-text search query (e.g., SELECT ts_headline(...), ts_rank(...) WHERE tsvector_column @@ tsquery)
    PG->>Parser: Parse tsquery, extract search lexemes
    Parser-->>PG: Return lexemes
    PG->>GIN: Lookup lexemes in GIN index
    GIN-->>PG: Return matching row pointers (TIDs)
    PG->>PG: Intersect/union TID lists as per tsquery logic

    loop For each matching TID
        PG->>Heap: Fetch row from heap using TID
        Heap-->>PG: Return row data
        PG->>Ranker: Compute rank with ts_rank(tsvector, tsquery)
        Ranker-->>PG: Return rank score
        PG->>Ranker: Generate snippet with ts_headline(text, tsquery, options)
        Note right of Ranker: Options:<br/>MinWords, MaxWords,<br/>ShortWord, MaxFragments,<br/>StartSel, StopSel,<br/>FragmentDelimiter
        Ranker-->>PG: Return highlighted snippet
    end

    PG-->>App: Return ranked and highlighted results
